<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 189 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 189 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were all out for 189 off 50 overs in their Singer Champions Trophy match against Pakistan on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
